OL,3,A'I'd rather die than ring the police':
OL,4,ADistrust and fear in Middlesbrough
OL,5,Aafter A66 crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is just after 8pm in Grangetown,
OL,8,Fnear Middlesbrough, and the light is
OL,9,Ffading.
OL,11,FTwo teenagers in balaclavas tear across
OL,12,Fa park on a muddy red quad bike,
OL,13,Fpulling wheelies as they pass a man
OL,14,Fwalking his dog.
OL,16,FYounger boys, some not yet in their
OL,17,Fteens, gather excitedly around the
OL,18,Fbike.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
