OL,3,ATrump's peace envoys to visit Moscow
OL,4,Aand Kyiv over weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS negotiators Steve Witkoff and Jared
OL,7,FKushner will visit Russia and Ukraine
OL,8,Fthis weekend, as efforts to end the war
OL,9,Fappear to be gathering pace.
OL,11,FUkraine's Volodymyr Zelensky confirmed
OL,12,Fhe will meet the envoys on Sunday,
OL,13,Fafter they visit Moscow on Saturday to
OL,14,Fhold talks with Russian President
OL,15,FVladimir Putin.
OL,17,FWitkoff and Kushner have led US
OL,18,FPresident Donald Trump's efforts to
OL,19,Fbroker a peace deal, but a gulf remains
OL,20,Fbetween the two warring sides.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
