OL,3,AEurope targeted by spiralling campaign
OL,4,Aof sabotage - and Russia is the chief
OL,5,Asuspect
OL,6,
OL,7,FA full month after drones packed with
OL,8,Fexplosives were found at Leipzig's
OL,9,Fairport, used by Ukraine to transport
OL,10,Fmilitary goods, Germany's interior
OL,11,Fminister has declared that "Russia is
OL,12,Fresponsible".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
